@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：賣家實體書櫃存書

actor 賣家 as Seller
actor 買家 as Buyer
participant "SalesHistoryScreen" as UI
participant "ApiService(OrdersApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "PATCH /api/orders/:id/status" as Route
participant "orders/index.js" as OrdersSvc
participant "orders/settlement.js" as Settlement
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

Seller -> Seller : 依App顯示格位，\n將書實體放入智慧書櫃
Seller -> UI : 點擊「已放入書櫃」
UI -> UI : showConfirmDialog(確認存書)
UI -> ApiSvc : updateOrderStatus(orderId, 'deposited')
ApiSvc -> Route : PATCH /api/orders/:id/status
Route -> OrdersSvc : advance(orderId, user, 'deposited')
OrdersSvc -> OrdersSvc : 檢查操作者為訂單賣家(或admin)
OrdersSvc -> OrdersSvc : 檢查 order.status ∈\nTRANSITIONS.deposited.from
alt 狀態不符
  OrdersSvc --> UI : 400「此訂單目前非待存書狀態」
else 狀態符合
  OrdersSvc -> Settlement : transition(tx, order, 'deposited')
  Settlement -> DB : guardedUpdate\n(WHERE status=讀取時狀態，\n防併發重複轉態)
  Settlement -> Settlement : phaseOf('deposited') == 'held'\n（不異動金流）
  Settlement --> OrdersSvc : 完成
  OrdersSvc -> DB : notify 買家「書已存入書櫃，\n請至機台掃描QR Code取書」
  OrdersSvc --> UI : 200 OK
  DB --> Buyer : 推播通知
end

note over Seller, DB
  目前版本中，智慧書櫃並未即時回報
  格位感測狀態；存書完成與否
  純由賣家於App端人工確認回報。
end note
@enduml
